["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/contentIdentifier", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "A canonical, unique, immutable identifier of the artifact content, that may be\nused for verifying its identity and/or integrity.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
